      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>To my elder, my chie, my noble one, my great one, Ab\u016b l-Faraj Y\u016bsuf ibn Ya\u02bfq\u016bb</li>\n<li>Ibn \u02bfAwkal, may his soul be at rest, may God perpetuate is wellbeing, his happiness, and his protection,</li>\n<li>from M\u016bs\u0101 ibn Is\u1e25aq ibn \u1e24isd\u0101, the one who loves him and has affection for him.</li>\n<li>May it arrive in Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d, if God wills.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
